# p5 usage (v0.0.16 only): twelve models this month from a seeded cache
# (p5-usage-mkcache.py): the ten-row cap, the "N more" row, the window
# following the selection down and back, at this terminal's height.
fx: homefile .fx/usage-cache/c5482018bc3612f715c33c5a278e44485d3bc741118d70cfeff2c0aa3f94fc4e.json p5-usage-cache-many.json
models models.json
